in office is on Library West’s first floor.","short_summary":"A named academic-support destination for targeted help beyond solo studying.","evidence_claim":"FGCU says the Center for Academic Achievement offers academic coaching, tutoring, supplemental instruction, and writing consultations in Library West.","source_url":"https://www.fgcu.edu/campusmap/ada","source_title":"Campus Map – Accessibility Tour","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The main office is on Library West’s first floor; writing and tutoring services are on the second floor, with elevator access available.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fgcu-food-forest","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"FGCU Food Forest","title":"Walk Through the Student-Run Food Forest","subtitle":"A botanical garden of tropical and subtropical edible species","notes":"Visit between sunrise and sunset, follow posted garden etiquette, and use the official involvement link if you want to help.","short_summary":"A living campus landscape where food systems and student stewardship meet.","evidence_claim":"FGCU identifies the Food Forest as a student-run botanical garden and says it supports educational and service-learning opportunities.","source_url":"https://www.fgcu.edu/cas/communityimpact/foodforest/","source_title":"FGCU Food Forest","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open to the community from sunrise to sunset; it is near the main entrance road, past Sugden Welcome Center and beside Kleist Health Center.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fgcu-waterfront-at-lake-como","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Waterfront at Lake Como","title":"Plan a Lake Como Recreation Break","subtitle":"FGCU’s designated student swimmi